    "authoritativeText": [{"lesson": "geo68-c1-s4", "text": "证明．设已知两条直线$a$和$b$．我们假定它们的交点多于一个，即有交点$M$和$N$（图9）．那么经过$M$和$N$两点的直线就不只一条，而是两条，即直线$a$和$b$．但是这和命题5矛盾．$\\blacksquare$"}],
    "inventory": [{
      "id": "source-contradiction-sketch",
      "description": "Original actual PNG: upper-left a path descends through M, bends down in middle, rises through N, then continues to the upper-right tail; lower-left b path rises through M, bends up in middle, descends through N, then continues to the lower-right tail. M left and N right are shared crossing labels, a above left, b below left. Left paths solid, right paths dashed from central bends onward. No other point labels, numerical data or arrowheads. Preserve the impossible hypothetical sketch exactly in meaning; chosen coordinates only regularize the layout. Hidden bend/end points implement drawn strokes and are not new source givens. M/N rendered dots are a declared modern readability addition at the same source crossings.",
      "objects": ["point-m", "point-n", "a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "b1", "b2", "b3", "b4", "label-a", "label-b"],
      "assertions": ["m-n-order", "a1-connect", "a2-connect", "a3-connect", "a4-connect", "b1-connect", "b2-connect", "b3-connect", "b4-connect"],
      "requires": ["pointRelationships"]
    }]
  },
